<title>USA: CIENA chief technology officer resigns.</title>
<headline>CIENA chief technology officer resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LINTHICUM, Md. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>CIENA Corp said on Tuesday that David Huber, director, senior vice president, and chief technology officer, has resigned his positions with the company to pursue other interests.</p>
</text>
